  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Buna-S is a copolymer of 1,3-butadiene and styrene. It is prepared by copolymerisation of 1,3 butadiene and styrene along with sodium.&nbsp;In this process peroxide is used as a catalyst at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>&nbsp;therefore the formed product is also known as cold rubber.&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0005_3632076f846e.png\" style=\"width: 626px; height: 130px;\" /></p>"
  }
